    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Call on the Power of the Heavens</p></blockquote><p>Your pact draws on the Upper Planes, realms of everlasting bliss. You might enter an agreement with an empyrean, a couatl, a sphinx, a unicorn, or another heavenly entity, or call on many such beings as you pursue goals aligned with theirs. Your pact lets you feel a hint of the holy light that illuminates the multiverse.</p><h3>Celestial Patron Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.bL8KQuiLGyk586yG]{Celestial Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.D5jgEotRW65iKG3C]{Healing Light}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.4G7kBFqeZhZr34fF]{Radiant Soul}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.1XIvbbwfdWpM0IEC]{Celestial Resilience}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.l5w5MQxK1IQc55mA]{Searing Vengeance}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Celestial Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Warlock Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplAid0000000]{Aid}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCureWounds]{Cure Wounds}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGuidingBol]{Guiding Bolt}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLesserRest]{Lesser Restoration}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLight00000]{Light}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSacredFlam]{Sacred Flame}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDaylight00]{Daylight}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRevivify00]{Revivify}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGuardianof]{Guardian of Faith}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWallofFire]{Wall of Fire}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGreaterRes]{Greater Restoration}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.jivWkxHu2huBXV0U]{Summon Celestial}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
